X-WR-CALNAME:Bakerloo disruption
BEGIN:VEVENT
DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://tfl.gov.uk/tube-dlr-overground/status/?Input=&lineIds=&dateTypeSelect=Future%20date&direction=&startDate=2026-11-26T10:00:00&endDate=2026-11-27T18:00:00">Disruption map.</a>\n\nTUBE STRIKE: Some London Underground Tube drivers are planning to take strike action from 1200 Thursday 26 until 1159 Friday 27 November. A normal service is expected until 1000 Thursday when services will begin to reduce. From 1200\, there will be disruption on all lines and no service is expected after 2100. No trains will run all day Thursday and until 1200 Friday on the Circle and Piccadilly lines\, or on the Waterloo & City line between 1200 Thursday and 1200 Friday. Disruption will continue between 1200 and 1800 Friday\, with a normal service expected after then
DTEND:20261127T180000Z
DTSTART:20261126T100000Z
SUMMARY:Bakerloo: Reduced Service
UID:f10abe05-7e03-4ef6-89dd-e5c0dcc2010a@f10a.org
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://tfl.gov.uk/tube-dlr-overground/status/?Input=&lineIds=&dateTypeSelect=Future%20date&direction=&startDate=2026-12-19T12:00:00&endDate=2026-12-20T11:59:00">Disruption map.</a>\n\nTUBE STRIKE: Some London Underground Tube drivers are planning to take strike action from 12:00 Saturday 19 until 11:59 Sunday 20 December. There is likely to be some disruption across all Underground lines\, but trains are expected to run on most lines.
DTEND:20261220T115900Z
DTSTART:20261219T120000Z
SUMMARY:Bakerloo: Special Service
UID:0d28909b-59a2-48cc-b2e1-98424cb36120@0d28.org
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://tfl.gov.uk/tube-dlr-overground/status/?Input=&lineIds=&dateTypeSelect=Future%20date&direction=&startDate=2026-12-06T04:30:00&endDate=2026-12-07T01:29:00">Disruption map.</a>\n\nBAKERLOO LINE: Sunday 6 December\, no service between Queens Park and Harrow & Wealdstone. There will also be no LIONESS LINE service between Willesden Junction and Harrow & Wealdstone. Special bus service 718 operates. LONDON NORTH WESTERN RAILWAY trains continue to stop at Harrow & Wealdstone. SOUTHERN trains stop at Wembley Central and Harrow & Wealdstone between 1300 and 2000 only
DTEND:20261207T012900Z
DTSTART:20261206T043000Z
SUMMARY:Bakerloo: Part Closure
